            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 27,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the Fourteenth Amendment does not protect the right to an abortion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "70091abee490f2ed61351bd072823e0743d6dd01b6f664359dbcf25bc755e0ad",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-70091abee490-0008-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 79,
              "start": 79
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Roe v. Wade and Planned Parenthood v. Casey were overruled, returning authority over abortion regulation to the states."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "70091abee490f2ed61351bd072823e0743d6dd01b6f664359dbcf25bc755e0ad",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-70091abee490-0005-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court identified five factors that strongly favor overruling Roe and Casey."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "70091abee490f2ed61351bd072823e0743d6dd01b6f664359dbcf25bc755e0ad",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-70091abee490-0008-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 89,
              "start": 89
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The judgment of the Fifth Circuit was reversed and the case remanded."
      }
    ],
